            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method of making an optical waveguide structure, the method comprising: forming a reflective optical element, wherein forming the reflective optical element comprises: providing a plurality of protrusions on an area of a surface of a waveguide; and depositing a reflective material on the area to form a layer on surfaces of the plurality of protrusions, the layer having at least one parameter that varies across the area, wherein a reflectivity of the reflective optical element varies with the at least one parameter of the layer across the area.</p>
            </abstract>
